-- Sloppanizer baseline (schemaVersion 9 = SCHEMA_BASE 8 + this migration). Generated by drizzle-kit from
-- src/db/auth-schema.ts and src/db/schema.ts, then edited by hand where drizzle-kit cannot express it:
-- - labels, topics and person_tags: name COLLATE NOCASE; name_key nullable (the schema says notNull so
--   inserts must set it; a restore leaves it out and services/name-keys.ts fills it; NULLs never clash).
-- - todos.recurrence: CHECK json_valid. The partial unique index names its column without the table.
-- - search_fts (FTS5) at the end.
-- Never edit this file once committed: fix forward with a new migration.
